# VS Code
# The debug configuration IS tracked: it is the only way to run the extension
# from the sources (F5), and a `git clean -xdf` wipes everything ignored -
# a local-only launch.json disappears without a trace and F5 silently does
# nothing. The personal settings of each developer stay ignored.
.vscode/*
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
.vscode-test/
.env

# ANTLR dev tools (jar requis seulement pour régénérer les sources du parser)
database/tsql-grammar/antlr.jar
